19
00:00:28,852 --> 00:00:29,375
Surat penangkapan ini,

20
00:00:29,978 --> 00:00:31,266
capnya palsu.

21
00:00:31,326 --> 00:00:32,972
Cap besar prefektur,

22
00:00:33,835 --> 00:00:35,465
