25
00:00:38,260 --> 00:00:38,988
Usir mereka!

26
00:00:41,848 --> 00:00:42,175
Tunggu.

27
00:00:42,323 --> 00:00:42,688
Yang ini?

28
00:00:43,230 --> 00:00:44,976
Surat kabar kelulusan juara pertama ujian provinsi, dari prefektur.

29
00:00:45,049 --> 00:00:45,554
Dua cap,

30
00:00:45,865 --> 00:00:47,352
lihat di depan lampu.

31
00:00:49,370 --> 00:00:50,576
Beda satu goresan.

32
00:00:52,570 --> 00:00:54,023
Beda satu goresan,

33
00:00:54,086 --> 00:00:55,033
apa artinya?

34
00:00:55,961 --> 00:00:56,411
Nyonya,

35
00:00:57,002 --> 00:00:58,769
ada yang memakai cap prefektur untuk menangkap orang.

36
00:00:58,844 --> 00:00:59,824
Kalau terjadi apa-apa,

37
00:00:59,879 --> 00:01:01,317
yang menanggung adalah Tuan Prefek.

38
00:01:01,931 --> 00:01:02,472
Pelayan!

39
00:01:02,612 --> 00:01:03,470
Panggil Tuan pulang.

40
00:01:04,091 --> 00:01:04,816
Capku sendiri,

41
00:01:05,094 --> 00:01:06,678
