51
00:01:20,946 --> 00:01:24,073
Poin suka Tang Xiaotang, enam puluh satu.

52
00:01:24,459 --> 00:01:27,458
Kereta tahanan sebelum fajar

53
00:01:28,240 --> 00:01:29,348
